            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The first step (as per 'CONTRIBUTING.md') is to create an issue *describing reproduction steps* in full and only that. I don't really appreciate having to read through the whole LLM generated comment to stumble upon the relevant bit in the spoiler.\r\n\r\nI will not be merging this PR, but will take a look at the problem. Please don't create a new issue for this.",
